ain uses of lasers in surgery. Lasers can create precise and controlled cuts, which is especially useful in delicate or complex procedures.\n4. Illuminating operating fields (B) is another use of lasers in surgery. Lasers can provide bright and focused light, which helps surgeons see better and perform their tasks more accurately.\n5. Stitching wounds (C) is not a typical use of lasers in surgery. Lasers are not used to sew or stitch tissues together.\n6. Disinfecting instruments (D) is not a primary use of lasers in surgery. While lasers can have some sterilizing effects, they are not commonly used for disinfecting surgical instruments.", "new_cot_probs": [1.280713695450686e-05, 1.6121806822866347e-07, 1.0306326458930926e-08, 9.586377247572386e-10], "cot_prob": [-0.36979472637176514], "cot_step_prob": [-0.4470621645450592], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 323, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 322, "step_token_count": 14}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.04132542759180069, 0.856619656085968, 0.7721311450004578, 0.7421674728393555, 0.6942514777183533, 0.682807445526123, 0.6316087245941162, 0.6180001497268677, 0.6487074494361877, 0.6354661583900452, 0.6398699283599854, 0.645481526851654, 0.6388682723045349, 0.6229943633079529, 0.6472722887992859, 0.6082658767700195, 0.6096635460853577, 0.6163792014122009, 0.6083865761756897, 0.6646361351013184, 0.6530470252037048, 0.6401561498641968, 0.6545271277427673, 0.681985080242157, 0.6868980526924133, 0.7371190786361694, 0.7577715516090393, 0.7671012282371521, 0.8022652268409729, 0.8142107725143433, 0.8325681686401367, 0.8488574028015137, 0.7135778069496155], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999649524688721, 0.9999004602432251, 0.9997344017028809, 0.9996448755264282, 0.999412477016449, 0.9992666244506836, 0.9990523457527161, 0.9987679719924927, 0.9987460374832153, 0.9982700347900391, 0.9982136487960815, 0.9962937831878662, 0.9962352514266968, 0.996330380439758