unction. Cells are the basic units of life, the smallest living entities that can perform all the processes of life.\n- Cells are a type of biological entity, which is a living or non-living thing that has a cellular structure. Biological entities are the fundamental units of life, the smallest entities that can be considered alive.\n- Biological entities are a type of organism, which is a living thing that can grow, reproduce, respond to stimuli, and adapt to its environment. Organisms are the basic units of biology, the smallest entities that can be classified as living.\n- Organisms are a type of living thing, which is a complex and highly organized system of cells that can perform all the functions of life. Living things are the basic units of life, the smallest entities that can be considered alive.", "new_cot_probs": [6.447843929890951e-07, 9.381557219967362e-07, 9.381557219967362e-07, 0.0011657974682748318], "cot_prob": [-2.525439977645874], "cot_step_prob": [-5.440232753753662], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 190, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 170, "step_token_count": 22}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.04583875089883804, 0.8623080253601074, 0.7444625496864319, 0.42592930793762207, 0.4238835275173187, 0.48289328813552856, 0.4860204756259918, 0.48923632502555847, 0.648306131362915, 0.6285576224327087, 0.6277781128883362, 0.6381360292434692, 0.6229454278945923, 0.6039051413536072, 0.6151571869850159, 0.5751251578330994, 0.5669275522232056, 0.5744730830192566, 0.5873020887374878, 0.6261122226715088, 0.6026945114135742, 0.5857855677604675, 0.57740718126297, 0.6034944653511047, 0.6191642880439758, 0.657931923866272, 0.6816343069076538, 0.675541341304779, 0.7313330173492432, 0.7592995166778564, 0.7915729880332947, 0.8217003345489502, 0.7636334896087646], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.999953031539917, 0.999880850315094, 0.9991662502288818, 0.9991158246994019, 0.9986834526062012, 0.998866915