 fibers that coordinates and controls the body's activities, but it is not designed to shield the brain from external forces.\n- The digestive system is the organ system that breaks down food into nutrients that can be absorbed by the body, but it does not provide any protection to the brain.\n- The skeletal system is the framework of bones and cartilage that supports and shapes the body, and it also protects vital organs, including the brain.", "new_cot_probs": [1.1141019058413804e-05, 3.8885973481228575e-05, 0.017776519060134888, 2.485897311998997e-06], "cot_prob": [-1.5906493663787842], "cot_step_prob": [-4.640471935272217], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 210, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 194, "step_token_count": 21}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.03412666916847229, 0.8652156591415405, 0.7641044855117798, 0.43775784969329834, 0.43681609630584717, 0.4793298542499542, 0.4830264151096344, 0.49118831753730774, 0.6623826026916504, 0.6462095379829407, 0.6323397159576416, 0.6377260684967041, 0.6113297939300537, 0.5854117274284363, 0.6264973282814026, 0.5944696664810181, 0.6086909770965576, 0.596511721611023, 0.5849376320838928, 0.6431112289428711, 0.6268596649169922, 0.6164582967758179, 0.6017820835113525, 0.6186107397079468, 0.6217733025550842, 0.6788302659988403, 0.6958195567131042, 0.6925968527793884, 0.7334994077682495, 0.7605925798416138, 0.7871386408805847, 0.8124873638153076, 0.8174974918365479], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999020099639893, 0.9998699426651001, 0.9997628331184387, 0.9997313022613525, 0.9995157718658447, 0.9994017481803894, 0.9988802671432495, 0.9988375902175903, 0.9989689588546753, 0.9988563060760498, 0.9986738562583923, 0.9989069104194641, 0.9985567331314087, 0.9985465407371521, 0.9980119466781616, 0.9978548884391785, 0.9972133636474609, 0.9973740577697754, 0.9976500272750854, 0.99751877784729, 0.9974506497383118, 0.9972823262214661, 0.9970887899398804, 0.99697744846