wth.\n3. We know that plants require macronutrients and micronutrients for their growth.\n4. Macronutrients are needed in larger quantities and include nitrogen (N), phosphorus (P), and potassium (K).\n5. Micronutrients are needed in smaller quantities and include elements like iron, manganese, zinc, copper, etc.\n6. The question asks for an ingredient that is not a chemical.\n7. We can eliminate options (A), (B), and (D) because they are all macronutrients and are considered chemicals.\n8. This leaves us with option (C) carbohydrates.\n9. Carbohydrates are not considered chemicals in the context of plant nutrition.\n10. Therefore, the correct answer is (C) carbohydrates.", "new_cot_probs": [3.606465126537728e-09, 6.329543555949613e-09, 1.0099367500515655e-05, 5.585802487217961e-09], "cot_prob": [-1.2988100051879883], "cot_step_prob": [-2.607631206512451], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 194, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 175, "step_token_count": 21}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.030905162915587425, 0.8553548455238342, 0.7704880237579346, 0.7239803075790405, 0.6710594892501831, 0.6718107461929321, 0.6231343150138855, 0.6113576292991638, 0.647628903388977, 0.626192569732666, 0.6254311203956604, 0.6449083089828491, 0.6288865804672241, 0.6040778756141663, 0.6244481205940247, 0.597875714302063, 0.5885952115058899, 0.6011080741882324, 0.5977277159690857, 0.634937584400177, 0.6204733848571777, 0.6046870350837708, 0.5759780406951904, 0.6187455654144287, 0.625510573387146, 0.6938002109527588, 0.7070460319519043, 0.7102141380310059, 0.7593778967857361, 0.7823750972747803, 0.8021097779273987, 0.819938600063324, 0.6679927110671997], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999517202377319, 0.9998787045478821, 0.9997606873512268, 0.9997164011001587, 0.9994993209838867, 0.9995278716087341, 0.9995123147964478, 0.9992018938064575, 0.9992107152938843, 0.998923659324646, 0.9986060261726379, 0.9985629320144653, 0.9979