 heat away from your body more efficiently than carpet, making it feel colder.\n6. When you touch a carpet floor, it does not conduct heat away from your body as efficiently, making it feel warmer.\n7. Therefore, the correct answer is (B) The tile floor conducts heat better than the carpet.", "new_cot_probs": [1.3427293943379937e-08, 2.1424481019494124e-05, 2.996034309532547e-09, 8.144064977955168e-09], "cot_prob": [-0.3168637752532959], "cot_step_prob": [-0.6822274327278137], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 305, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 296, "step_token_count": 17}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.049894414842128754, 0.8686565160751343, 0.7821134328842163, 0.7421494126319885, 0.7039961814880371, 0.6937679052352905, 0.6513586044311523, 0.6234487295150757, 0.6610219478607178, 0.6606841683387756, 0.647628664970398, 0.6411954760551453, 0.6239215731620789, 0.6000498533248901, 0.6396723985671997, 0.590961217880249, 0.5890052914619446, 0.5927586555480957, 0.5951206684112549, 0.6514360904693604, 0.6393775939941406, 0.6293415427207947, 0.6331523656845093, 0.6592073440551758, 0.6714377403259277, 0.7208001017570496, 0.7393742799758911, 0.7410758137702942, 0.7798946499824524, 0.7923893332481384, 0.8183847665786743, 0.8387724161148071, 0.6266158819198608], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999534487724304, 0.9999117851257324, 0.9998488426208496, 0.9997905492782593, 0.9995872974395752, 0.9995197057723999, 0.9988470077514648, 0.9988746047019958, 0.999000072479248, 0.9989816546440125, 0.9989754557609558, 0.9990979433059692, 0.999016284942627, 0.998948335647583, 0.9988278746604919, 0.9985675811767578, 0.9983950853347778, 0.9984284043312073, 0.9986093640327454, 0.9983492493629456, 0.9984440803527832, 0.9985994696617126, 0.9986447095870972, 0.9986549019813538, 0.9988785982131958, 0.998794674873352, 0.9987989664077759, 0.9988902807235718, 0.9988617897033691, 0.9988905787467957, 0.9989215731620789, 0.9975345134