{"id": "Mercury_7127943", "question": "As early as the 1600s, scientists noticed that the continents appeared to fit together like pieces of a puzzle. The idea that the continents were once together and had drifted apart was not widely accepted. In the 1940s, technology used on submarines led to evidence of continental movement. This technology allowed the scientists to do which of these?", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): to explain the mechanism that caused the continents to move", "B): to consider the glacial evidence as outdated", "C): to explain the extinction of the dinosaurs", "D): to consider it unlikely that the continents were once together"], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "1. The question is about the technology used on submarines in the 1940s that provided evidence of continental movement.\n2. The technology mentioned is not specified, but it is implied that it was related to the study of the ocean floor.\n3. The technology allowed scientists to gather evidence of continental movement.\n4. The question asks what the technology enabled scientists to do.", "initial_cot_probs": [3.967677184846252e-05, 3.889774120580114e-07, 1.709047481313064e-08, 1.709047481313064e-08], "initial_probs": [0.0001998753723455593, 3.660845322883688e-06, 2.0653075694099243e-07, 4.954415544489166e-07], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "adapter_id": "Mercury_7127943_step_1", "global_job_index": 1390, "cot_step": "The question is about the technology used on submarines in the 1940s that provided evidence of continental movement.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The question is about the technology used on submarines in the 1940s that provided evidence of continental movement.", "2.", "The technology mentioned is not specified, but it is implied that it was related to the study of the ocean floor.", "3.", "The technology allowed scientists to gather evidence of continental movement.", "4.", "The question asks what the technology enabled scientists to do."], "causal_cot": {"loss": "fr