arth's surface in the form of rain, snow, sleet, or hail. It does not return water to the atmosphere.\n   (D) Transpiration: This process involves water absorption by plant roots and its movement through the plant to the leaves, where it evaporates into the atmosphere. It also returns water to the atmosphere.", "new_cot_probs": [1.6821732895522246e-10, 3.0414403795475664e-07, 9.004024609238215e-11, 8.542780927101035e-10], "cot_prob": [-0.945933997631073], "cot_step_prob": [-3.4858205318450928], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 222, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 208, "step_token_count": 19}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.02491755597293377, 0.8488685488700867, 0.7710123658180237, 0.740799069404602, 0.6895596385002136, 0.6771193146705627, 0.6199816465377808, 0.5925978422164917, 0.6238675713539124, 0.62175452709198, 0.6115368604660034, 0.618556797504425, 0.6020652055740356, 0.5727109909057617, 0.588053286075592, 0.5404869914054871, 0.5580987930297852, 0.5471848249435425, 0.5380606651306152, 0.6069303154945374, 0.606370210647583, 0.6188200116157532, 0.6052087545394897, 0.6459935903549194, 0.6634153723716736, 0.7129517197608948, 0.7265262603759766, 0.7332881093025208, 0.775394082069397, 0.792097270488739, 0.817095160484314, 0.8337447047233582, 0.6547900438308716], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999366998672485, 0.9998403191566467, 0.9997528791427612, 0.9997209310531616, 0.999396562576294, 0.9993588328361511, 0.9992435574531555, 0.9990622401237488, 0.9990606307983398, 0.9989849328994751, 0.9988883137702942, 0.9989074468612671, 0.9982175827026367, 0.9981017112731934, 0.997320830821991, 0.995829701423645, 0.9941489100456238, 0.992919921875, 0.9935558438301086, 0.9928898811340332, 0.9929234981536865, 0.9914164543151855, 0.9917980432510376, 0.9915632605552673, 0.9930683970451355, 0.9930902719497681, 0.9935201406478882, 0.9940738677978516, 0.9941307902336121, 0.9942788481712341, 0.9945365190505981, 0.989