h force is needed to change its velocity.\n4. The speed of an object is its velocity, which is a measure of how fast it is moving.\n5. The texture of an object refers to its surface characteristics, which do not directly affect its acceleration.\n6. The volume of an object refers to the amount of space it occupies, which also does not directly affect its acceleration.", "new_cot_probs": [2.1434983864310198e-05, 7.190636086562563e-09, 1.6044475747989395e-09, 2.4605001369693014e-10], "cot_prob": [-0.3412643373012543], "cot_step_prob": [-0.5619495511054993], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 249, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 236, "step_token_count": 19}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.018642444163560867, 0.850326418876648, 0.7802987098693848, 0.7573415040969849, 0.7213956713676453, 0.723346471786499, 0.6674643158912659, 0.6600343585014343, 0.681036114692688, 0.6709447503089905, 0.6642618775367737, 0.675884485244751, 0.6560059785842896, 0.6348011493682861, 0.6467283368110657, 0.5897654294967651, 0.6019479632377625, 0.6074321269989014, 0.6135664582252502, 0.6617431640625, 0.6445233821868896, 0.6436637043952942, 0.6498615741729736, 0.6757429242134094, 0.6793926358222961, 0.7341336011886597, 0.7494683861732483, 0.7626200318336487, 0.8011743426322937, 0.8190775513648987, 0.8340532183647156, 0.8497155904769897, 0.641405463218689], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999200105667114, 0.9998708963394165, 0.9996744394302368, 0.9995893836021423, 0.99942547082901, 0.9994596838951111, 0.9988883137702942, 0.9988219738006592, 0.9988723397254944, 0.9988406300544739, 0.9989426136016846, 0.9991140961647034, 0.9990404844284058, 0.9990173578262329, 0.9985985159873962, 0.9983648061752319, 0.9980410933494568, 0.9979968070983887, 0.9983794689178467, 0.9982582926750183, 0.9983270764350891, 0.9985425472259521, 0.9986371397972107, 0.9985727667808533, 0.9987186193466187, 0.9987361431121826, 0.9987325668334961, 0.99887531995773