n that reaches the plants. Sunlight is essential for photosynthesis, which is the process by which plants convert light energy into chemical energy.\n8. Considering the options, the factor that most likely accounts for the high productivity of some areas in mountain valleys is (D) amounts of sunlight.", "new_cot_probs": [1.1029905877535384e-09, 1.6048417039726814e-09, 1.2498519996739788e-09, 1.6697682440280914e-05], "cot_prob": [-0.30914852023124695], "cot_step_prob": [-0.7495438456535339], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 392, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 398, "step_token_count": 7}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [-0.009066700004041195, 0.805931568145752, 0.7297361493110657, 0.7051209807395935, 0.6758561134338379, 0.6808375716209412, 0.6395550966262817, 0.6404856443405151, 0.6862624287605286, 0.6785074472427368, 0.6725435853004456, 0.6622855067253113, 0.6372284889221191, 0.6203246116638184, 0.6553001403808594, 0.6120849251747131, 0.6243194937705994, 0.6287323236465454, 0.624354362487793, 0.676062285900116, 0.6655123233795166, 0.6518511772155762, 0.637468695640564, 0.6613397598266602, 0.6727254390716553, 0.7310647368431091, 0.7430615425109863, 0.7360101342201233, 0.7806406617164612, 0.7884284853935242, 0.8086447715759277, 0.8309329748153687, 0.7119841575622559], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999529123306274, 0.9999120235443115, 0.9997961521148682, 0.9997012615203857, 0.9994572401046753, 0.9993337392807007, 0.9989729523658752, 0.9989009499549866, 0.9989842176437378, 0.9989199638366699, 0.9988466501235962, 0.9990058541297913, 0.9986976981163025, 0.9983882904052734, 0.997889518737793, 0.9979715943336487, 0.9969894289970398, 0.9966996908187866, 0.9974420070648193, 0.9975792169570923, 0.9976522326469421, 0.9972841739654541, 0.9974863529205322, 0.9974783062934875, 0.9978294372558594, 0.9978657960891724, 0.9976910948753357, 0.9981017112731934, 0.9980255365371704, 0.9982186555862427, 0.998388886451721