ex ecosystem, as they provide food and shelter for other organisms.\n4. Algae and small invertebrates are also crucial for a complex ecosystem, as they form the base of the food chain and contribute to nutrient cycling.\n5. Marine mammals and plants are important, but they are not the primary focus of artificial reefs.\n6. Bacteria and fungi play a role in nutrient cycling and decomposition, but they are not the main focus of artificial reefs.", "new_cot_probs": [1.648720535740722e-05, 4.168618488620268e-06, 1.703618934811857e-08, 3.3546245781224115e-09], "cot_prob": [-0.4065881073474884], "cot_step_prob": [-0.581896185874939], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 287, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 268, "step_token_count": 25}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.0009946823120117188, 0.8560444712638855, 0.7573833465576172, 0.7178663015365601, 0.6547674536705017, 0.653473436832428, 0.6104927659034729, 0.578425943851471, 0.6206424236297607, 0.6105854511260986, 0.6027745008468628, 0.618142306804657, 0.6023119688034058, 0.579027533531189, 0.6028861403465271, 0.5549986362457275, 0.5685755610466003, 0.5712668299674988, 0.5785784125328064, 0.630584716796875, 0.6139386296272278, 0.619339644908905, 0.6157731413841248, 0.6506761908531189, 0.6615942716598511, 0.7146207690238953, 0.7366185784339905, 0.7342796921730042, 0.7801405191421509, 0.7925931215286255, 0.8165716528892517, 0.8337880969047546, 0.5851014852523804], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999542236328125, 0.9998868703842163, 0.9997372627258301, 0.9997187852859497, 0.9994502663612366, 0.9993911385536194, 0.9988654851913452, 0.9988250732421875, 0.9988861083984375, 0.9987632036209106, 0.9987273216247559, 0.9988210797309875, 0.9987075924873352, 0.9986356496810913, 0.9982739090919495, 0.9979181289672852, 0.995891273021698, 0.9947258234024048, 0.9939393997192383, 0.9841158986091614, 0.9841341972351074, 0.9741321206092834, 0.9791206121444702, 0.9780934453010559