rals, including salts, into the atmosphere. These salts can eventually settle and contribute to the salt in the ocean. So, this option contributes to the salt in the ocean as well.\n4. Now, let's compare the options:\n   - Options (A), (B), and (C) all contribute to the salt in the ocean.\n5. Therefore, the correct answer is:", "new_cot_probs": [1.6255013335353397e-08, 2.492787087859938e-09, 3.62698382438964e-09, 6.428982146644557e-08], "cot_prob": [-0.6611813306808472], "cot_step_prob": [-1.7738269567489624], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 239, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 224, "step_token_count": 21}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.1805039346218109, 0.8706405758857727, 0.7924553751945496, 0.77179354429245, 0.7197710871696472, 0.7164928317070007, 0.6689432859420776, 0.6687547564506531, 0.6822446584701538, 0.6781267523765564, 0.6756421327590942, 0.6760444045066833, 0.6710646152496338, 0.6476746201515198, 0.6668079495429993, 0.6366938948631287, 0.6286269426345825, 0.6376801133155823, 0.6231275796890259, 0.6780510544776917, 0.6783901453018188, 0.669090986251831, 0.6730610728263855, 0.6975136399269104, 0.7046688199043274, 0.7584016919136047, 0.7712018489837646, 0.7659696340560913, 0.8094733953475952, 0.8172137141227722, 0.8325968384742737, 0.8509169816970825, 0.5603815317153931], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.999944269657135, 0.999869704246521, 0.9997320175170898, 0.9996743202209473, 0.9992339611053467, 0.9991039037704468, 0.9989530444145203, 0.9986797571182251, 0.9987218379974365, 0.9985525608062744, 0.9983053803443909, 0.9980067014694214, 0.9969732761383057, 0.9968925714492798, 0.9944813251495361, 0.9871171116828918, 0.9783954620361328, 0.972801923751831, 0.9748851656913757, 0.971584677696228, 0.9690965414047241, 0.9704601764678955, 0.9712467193603516, 0.9717609286308289, 0.9757449626922607, 0.9775381088256836, 0.9775457382202148, 0.9817609786987305, 0.982123613357544, 0.9842063188552856, 0.