 and urinate more.\n(B): You get thirsty and urinate less.\n(C): You get hungry and sweat more.\n(D): You get hungry and sweat less.\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n\n1.\nWhen you have too little water in your body, your kidneys excrete antidiuretic hormone (ADH).\n2.\nADH is a hormone that helps the body retain water by reducing the amount of water excreted in urine.\n3.\nWhen ADH is excreted, it means that the body is trying to conserve water.\n4.\nIn response to ADH, the body will try to retain water, which means it will urinate less.\n5.", "specificity_preds": [1, 2, 0, 2, 0, 2, 0, 2, 2, 0, 1, 1, 2, 0, 3, 0, 1, 0, 3, 1], "specificity_probs": [[9.941749340214301e-06, 0.013999025337398052, 1.2765459359798115e-05, 7.74264208303066e-06], [3.455539626884274e-05, 4.43700046162121e-05, 0.013940640725195408, 5.0277802074560896e-05], [0.000908547721337527, 3.7130268992768833e-06, 5.025035534345079e-07, 1.270527860697257e-07], [1.667022479523439e-05, 0.0010313502280041575, 0.0059350114315748215, 0.00013957808550912887], [0.002460115123540163, 6.90995648255921e-06, 1.541819869999017e-06, 4.74913940706756e-06], [0.00015264673857018352, 9.258493082597852e-05, 0.006490704603493214, 3.0057926778681576e-05], [0.00394020788371563, 4.37717571912799e-05, 9.266481356462464e-05, 1.824678292905446e-05], [5.362131105357548e-06, 5.362131105357548e-06, 0.006663242820650339, 8.840660484565888e-06], [4.741687007481232e-05, 0.0008404841064475477, 0.00797429122030735, 4.741687007481232e-05], [0.007990534417331219, 0.0001463517255615443, 0.00011397884372854605, 0.00030982663156464696], [0.0021046434994786978, 0.00270241592079401, 0.0016390980454161763, 0.0012765309074893594], [0.0007579931407235563, 0.00560085428878665, 0.0026456560008227825, 0.0007579931407235563], [1.1122388968942687e-05, 5.648415026371367e-05, 0.013821215368807316, 0.00025314438971690834], [0.006606948561966419, 0.00012101048196200281, 1.1255728168180212e-05, 1.6376987332478166e-05], [1.1991476185357897e-06, 1.28