ns that the body is trying to conserve water.\n4. As a result, you would urinate less because the body is trying to hold onto the water it has.\n5. Additionally, when the body is dehydrated, it triggers the sensation of thirst to encourage you to drink more water.", "new_cot_probs": [1.7244145666950317e-08, 1.4727512279932853e-05, 2.0595192218308966e-09, 1.8175195792835552e-09], "cot_prob": [-0.3834788203239441], "cot_step_prob": [-0.7130728363990784], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 278, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 259, "step_token_count": 23}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.029499424621462822, 0.8590899705886841, 0.7879103422164917, 0.7664585709571838, 0.721198320388794, 0.7107017636299133, 0.6615919470787048, 0.6368101239204407, 0.6610230803489685, 0.6467220783233643, 0.6568521857261658, 0.6701654195785522, 0.6498339772224426, 0.6412696838378906, 0.6537036895751953, 0.609578013420105, 0.6062972545623779, 0.6120973825454712, 0.6200631856918335, 0.6637497544288635, 0.6401205658912659, 0.6346036195755005, 0.639305830001831, 0.6627938747406006, 0.6830259561538696, 0.7391849160194397, 0.7540299892425537, 0.7577824592590332, 0.7959040403366089, 0.8117154240608215, 0.8241283297538757, 0.8413980007171631, 0.6588310599327087], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999444484710693, 0.9998345971107483, 0.9997152090072632, 0.999689519405365, 0.9994925260543823, 0.9993364810943604, 0.9988412857055664, 0.9986451864242554, 0.9986976385116577, 0.998749852180481, 0.9985051155090332, 0.9985942840576172, 0.9983987212181091, 0.9981679916381836, 0.9976404905319214, 0.996357262134552, 0.9881025552749634, 0.9883031845092773, 0.9891707301139832, 0.9869639873504639, 0.9872876405715942, 0.9871158003807068, 0.9885082244873047, 0.989489734172821, 0.9914605021476746, 0.991679310798645, 0.9917747974395752, 0.9930387139320374, 0.9936244487762451, 0.9941580295562744, 0.9945093393325806, 0.9879032969474792], "answer_norm_by_la