ly.\n   (D) Rift zones: This occurs when a tectonic plate is being pulled apart, causing the mantle to rise and melt.\n4. Based on the location of Mount St. Helens and the geologic processes involved, the most likely answer is (A) converging boundaries.", "new_cot_probs": [9.606302774045616e-05, 4.941948628101045e-09, 5.902316413397557e-10, 1.6910420286286865e-10], "cot_prob": [-1.1159520149230957], "cot_step_prob": [-2.9018394947052], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 301, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 267, "step_token_count": 39}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.012501634657382965, 0.8571105599403381, 0.7575814127922058, 0.545862078666687, 0.5335936546325684, 0.5858889818191528, 0.5694684386253357, 0.574600100517273, 0.6496825218200684, 0.6419527530670166, 0.6495087742805481, 0.6591859459877014, 0.6435894966125488, 0.6370944380760193, 0.6438990831375122, 0.6007341742515564, 0.614331066608429, 0.624481737613678, 0.6259859800338745, 0.6785794496536255, 0.6380401253700256, 0.6291803121566772, 0.6402518153190613, 0.6483386158943176, 0.6342872977256775, 0.6703994274139404, 0.6821920275688171, 0.6904832720756531, 0.7387848496437073, 0.7601396441459656, 0.7830696702003479, 0.7994447946548462, 0.5436234474182129], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9998674392700195, 0.9997084736824036, 0.9994195699691772, 0.9992978572845459, 0.9988598823547363, 0.9987225532531738, 0.9988660216331482, 0.9985325336456299, 0.9983377456665039, 0.9980916976928711, 0.9979257583618164, 0.9984380006790161, 0.9980857372283936, 0.9980860948562622, 0.9970923662185669, 0.9970061182975769, 0.9965587854385376, 0.9967761635780334, 0.9974035024642944, 0.9973628520965576, 0.9970995783805847, 0.9970194101333618, 0.9966194033622742, 0.996425986289978, 0.9962553381919861, 0.9952839612960815, 0.9945513606071472, 0.9951108694076538, 0.994308590888977, 0.9941809177398682, 0.9942658543586731, 0.9856060147285461], "answer_norm_by_layer": [1.664062