 amount of water that evaporates from the soil and plants.\nHigher evaporation rates can lead to water stress and lower productivity.\n6.\nRunoff from rains refers to the movement of water across the land surface.", "specificity_preds": [1, 2, 0, 2, 0, 2, 0, 2, 2, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 3, 0, 1, 0, 3, 1], "specificity_probs": [[3.4581819363666e-07, 0.0002606445923447609, 6.460734311986016e-07, 2.3767712775679684e-07], [2.8704828309855657e-06, 8.841709131957032e-06, 0.0019092775182798505, 7.802780601195991e-06], [0.00015776125655975193, 7.30579643004603e-07, 2.371844658455302e-07, 1.9469288403684004e-08], [4.365484983281931e-06, 0.0002700829936657101, 0.000942682265304029, 1.5237040315696504e-05], [0.0009048884967342019, 2.8800618565583136e-06, 1.3604447985926527e-06, 3.6980723052693065e-06], [2.069163201667834e-05, 9.774033969733864e-06, 0.0005336442263796926, 8.023016562219709e-07], [0.0006858712295070291, 4.62136404166813e-06, 1.827784944907762e-05, 2.182977823395049e-06], [7.30996987385879e-07, 1.0635943681336357e-06, 0.0011663727927953005, 1.3656822375196498e-06], [3.265481382186408e-06, 0.00013885179942008108, 0.0010259837144985795, 2.5431595531699713e-06], [0.0013988780556246638, 2.903278982557822e-05, 3.2898460631258786e-05, 4.224246004014276e-05], [0.0009730046731419861, 0.0003579484182409942, 0.0009730046731419861, 0.00021710667351726443], [0.00011357716721249744, 0.0009509700466878712, 0.0007406161748804152, 0.00011357716721249744], [2.095296395054902e-06, 3.714001286425628e-05, 0.002297771628946066, 0.00012963140034116805], [0.0018875772366300225, 2.6924844860332087e-05, 4.678836376115214e-06, 6.007744559610728e-06], [1.0605353963910602e-06, 6.915559879416833e-06, 3.701632294905721e-06, 0.001917493063956499], [0.0002500896225683391, 1.4870875020278618e-06, 1.59876963152783e-05, 6.199102813297941e-07], [2.1099580408190377e-05, 0.0011519979452714324, 2.8555177777889185e-06, 2.8555177777889185e-06], [0.0007071226136758924, 1.7527818272355944e-06, 7.306681482077693e-