d that dissolves in water to form carbonic acid (H2CO3), but it does not produce a significant number of ions.\n7. Motor oil is a nonpolar substance that does not dissolve in water and does not produce ions.", "new_cot_probs": [1.3004844731767662e-05, 1.4163415995582795e-09, 3.160285644288052e-10, 7.051549621994724e-11], "cot_prob": [-0.29711830615997314], "cot_step_prob": [-0.32646122574806213], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 371, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 345, "step_token_count": 37}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.22721152007579803, 0.879311203956604, 0.7928078770637512, 0.7604636549949646, 0.709871232509613, 0.6997580528259277, 0.6380320191383362, 0.6156452298164368, 0.6545675992965698, 0.6528732776641846, 0.6502609252929688, 0.6616331338882446, 0.6434927582740784, 0.621138334274292, 0.3358209729194641, 0.29417523741722107, 0.3181600570678711, 0.31356197595596313, 0.3260883092880249, 0.3846582770347595, 0.38149216771125793, 0.3922545909881592, 0.4173169732093811, 0.4549277424812317, 0.4669293761253357, 0.5291223526000977, 0.5697829127311707, 0.5988205075263977, 0.6554636359214783, 0.6890077590942383, 0.8001670837402344, 0.8250431418418884, 0.627078115940094], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999591112136841, 0.9998883008956909, 0.9995182752609253, 0.999562680721283, 0.9994144439697266, 0.9994539022445679, 0.9993928670883179, 0.999221682548523, 0.9991617202758789, 0.9989981651306152, 0.9988644123077393, 0.9989013671875, 0.998637318611145, 0.9986329078674316, 0.9982064962387085, 0.9981846809387207, 0.997552216053009, 0.9977322816848755, 0.99827641248703, 0.9984736442565918, 0.9985349774360657, 0.9984199404716492, 0.9984895586967468, 0.9984124898910522, 0.9986041784286499, 0.9987038969993591, 0.9985524415969849, 0.9987058043479919, 0.9987278580665588, 0.9986765384674072, 0.9986932277679443, 0.9970754384994507], "answer_norm_by_layer": [1.6640625, 4.5, 5.09375, 7.875, 10.1875, 13.1875, 18.